32:["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-6 rounded-lg bg-eng-green-50 p-4","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-1 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-eng-green-700","children":"The answer"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-[0.9375rem] leading-relaxed text-eng-navy-900","children":"The output reason in paragraph 3 is best supported, because it rests on several published trials and offers a mechanism. The personal example in paragraph 4 is weakest, because a single team treated as proof is anecdote rather than evidence. The unanswered objection in paragraph 5 also limits the claim, since it identifies workplaces the argument does not address."}]]}]
33:["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-4 rounded-lg border-l-4 border-eng-gold-500 bg-eng-gold-50 p-4","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-1 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-eng-gold-700","children":"Take this with you"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-[0.9375rem] leading-relaxed text-eng-navy-800","children":"The most memorable paragraph is often the weakest one. Vivid detail is not the same as sufficient evidence."}]]}]
